    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Beetroot chutney has the earth-sweet flavour of beetroot brightened with vinegar, warming spices, and the optional punch of fresh horseradish. The finished preserve is deep crimson-purple. It works alongside cold beef, smoked fish, salt beef, and strong cheese. Makes about four 300 g jars."
          }
        ]
      },
